.TH SOLARDECK 1 "2026" "solardeck 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
solardeck \- SolarEdge HD-Wave monitor over Modbus TCP
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B solardeck
[\fB\-\-sim\fR] [\fB\-\-sim\-hour\fR \fIH\fR] [\fB\-\-no\-splash\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Shows live production, house consumption and grid import/export of a SolarEdge inverter read through
Modbus TCP (SunSpec), with a production/consumption chart. Settings: gear button or Ctrl+,.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-sim
Connect to a built-in simulated inverter (no hardware needed).
.TP
.BI \-\-sim\-hour " H"
Hour of the day at which the simulation starts.
.TP
.B \-\-no\-splash
Skip the splash screen (or set SOLARDECK_NO_SPLASH=1).
.SH FILES
.TP
~/.local/share/solardeck/history.csv
Sample history used by the chart and the daily totals.
